# --- Per-package Prettier ownership (see .lintstagedrc.cjs) ---
# The root `format:check` guards repo-level files (root config, CI workflows)
# and the api package. The trees below are formatted by each package's own
# Prettier config + the per-package lint-staged on commit, NOT by this root
# sweep:
#   - web/ and web-admin/ resolve `prettier-plugin-tailwindcss` from their OWN
#     node_modules; that plugin is not installed at the workspace root, so a
#     root-level Prettier run cannot load their config at all.
#   - packages/contracts/ predates a shared Prettier config and carries mixed
#     quote/semi styles across files, so no single root config validates it.
# Formatting drift inside these trees is caught by their per-package tooling.
web/
web-admin/
packages/

# docs/ holds long-form prose, design specs, and operational runbooks — not
# code — so it is intentionally exempt from Prettier normalization.
docs/
